# FinanceHub - AI-Powered Finance Automation System

A comprehensive full-stack web application for automated bookkeeping, financial management, and business intelligence. Built with modern technologies to streamline financial operations for small to medium businesses.

## 🚀 Features

### Core Functionality
- **Multi-Organization Support**: Create and manage multiple business entities with role-based access control (Admin, Accountant, Viewer)
- **Complete Chart of Accounts**: Support for all major account types (Cash, Bank, Credit Card, AR/AP, Revenue, Expenses, Equity)
- **Transaction Management**: Full CRUD operations with AI-powered categorization and reconciliation
- **Invoice Automation**: Create, send, and track invoices with automated PDF generation
- **Expense Tracking**: Comprehensive expense management with receipt uploads
- **Reports Generation**: Financial reports with charts and analytics
- **Cash Flow Insights**: Real-time cash flow analysis and forecasting
- **Auto Bookkeeping**: AI-assisted transaction categorization and automated recurring entries

### AI Integration
- **Smart Categorization**: Claude AI automatically categorizes transactions based on descriptions
- **Invoice Summaries**: AI-generated summaries for client communications
- **Confidence Scoring**: AI provides confidence levels for automated decisions

### Security & Compliance
- **JWT Authentication**: Secure token-based authentication
- **OTP Verification**: Email-based OTP for password resets
- **Role-Based Access Control**: Granular permissions for different user roles
- **Audit Logging**: Complete audit trail for all financial operations
- **Data Encryption**: Secure password hashing and data protection

## 🛠️ Technology Stack

### Frontend
- **React 19** with TypeScript
- **React Router v7** for routing
- **Tailwind CSS** for styling
- **shadcn/ui** component library
- **Recharts** for data visualization
- **Framer Motion** for animations
- **React Query** for state management
- **PapaParse** for CSV import/export

### Backend
- **Node.js** with Express.js
- **Prisma ORM** with PostgreSQL
- **JWT** for authentication
- **bcrypt** for password hashing
- **Nodemailer** for email services
- **Anthropic Claude API** for AI features

### Database
- **PostgreSQL** with Prisma migrations
- **Comprehensive schema** for financial data
- **Multi-currency support**
- **Audit logging**

## 📊 Data Model

### Core Entities
- **Users**: Authentication and profile management
- **Organizations**: Multi-tenant business entities
- **Memberships**: User-organization relationships with roles
- **Accounts**: Chart of accounts with balances
- **Categories**: Transaction categorization with subcategories
- **Transactions**: Financial transactions with AI metadata
- **Invoices**: Billing with line items and PDF generation
- **Recurring Rules**: Automated recurring transactions
- **Audit Logs**: Complete activity tracking

### Key Features
- **Multi-currency transactions** with exchange rates
- **Transaction reconciliation** and status tracking
- **Invoice lifecycle management** (Draft → Sent → Paid)
- **Recurring transaction automation**
- **Receipt attachment support**

## 🔧 API Endpoints

### Authentication
- `POST /user-signup` - User registration
- `POST /user-login` - User login
- `POST /forgot-password` - Password reset request
- `POST /verify-otp` - OTP verification
- `PATCH /reset-password` - Password reset

### Transactions
- `POST /` - Create transaction
- `GET /` - List transactions
- `GET /:id` - Get transaction details
- `PATCH /:id` - Update transaction
- `DELETE /:id` - Delete transaction

### Invoices
- `POST /` - Create invoice
- `GET /` - List invoices
- `GET /:id` - Get invoice details
- `PATCH /:id` - Update invoice
- `DELETE /:id` - Delete invoice

### Reports
- `GET /` - Generate financial reports

### Accounts
- `POST /` - Create account
- `GET /` - List accounts
- `GET /:id` - Get account details
- `PATCH /:id` - Update account
- `DELETE /:id` - Delete account

